# ── Required ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Supabase project URL and PUBLISHABLE key (the new sb_publishable_... format).
# Get them at: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API.
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ── Optional ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Maps / Places key — enables Google-powered place search (Arabic +
# English, search-as-you-type) in the location picker. Without it the picker
# falls back to the platform geocoder (submit-only search, weaker Arabic
# coverage). The key must have the legacy "Places API" enabled in Google
# Cloud Console. Note: this is an EXPO_PUBLIC_ var, so it ships in the JS
# bundle — restrict the key by app bundle id / API in the Cloud Console.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSy...

# Firebase — only required if you wire up notify-technicians push.
# FIREBASE_API_KEY=
# FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=

# Environment label used by the app (development | staging | production).
# APP_ENV=development

# Public URL of the static page that handles the email-change confirmation
# redirect from Supabase. The page (docs/email-change-confirmation.html in
# this repo) auto-attempts to open the app via fixate:///auth/callback
# and includes a manual "Open Fixate" button as a fallback. The URL must
# also be added to Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → URL Configuration
# → Additional Redirect URLs. Optional — defaults to the live GitHub Pages
# URL of this repo:
#   https://muhammedatef98.github.io/fixate-mobile/email-change-confirmation.html
# Set this only to point a staging build at a different host.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_EMAIL_REDIRECT_URL=https://example.com/email-change-confirmation.html

# ── Dev-only OTP fallback (NEVER set in production builds) ─────────────────
# When all three are set AND __DEV__ is true, the phone OTP flow can sign
# in a single tester account using a fixed code (0000) without a real SMS
# provider. Leave UNSET for staging/production .env files.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_OTP_PHONE=+9665XXXXXXXX
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_OTP_EMAIL=devtester@phone.fixate.local
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_OTP_PASSWORD=replace-with-the-pre-created-account-password

# ── Edge function secrets (set via `supabase secrets set …`, NOT in this file) ─
# These never reach the client — they live only on Supabase Edge Functions.
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY   — required by delete-account, notify-technicians
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY           — required by create-payment
#   STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY      — returned to client by create-payment
#   FCM_PROJECT_ID              — Firebase project id
#   FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON    — service-account JSON for FCM HTTP v1
#   RESEND_API_KEY              — Resend (used by send-otp)
